(text "LCR METER ANALOG FRONT END  (1 kHz - 30 MHz)\n\nSignal chain: AD9851 DDS -> LPF -> ADA4817 driver -> 49.9R -> NODE_A -> Rref (relay ranged) -> NODE_B = DUT -> GND\nV_A and V_B are buffered, mixed to a ~5 kHz IF by two SA612A on a common Si5351 LO, and digitised\ntogether by a CS5343 stereo ADC over I2S. The ESP32-S3 (JC3248W535EN) runs a DFT on both channels:\n    Z = Rref * V_B / (V_A - V_B)   (complex), then open/short/load compensation.\nBelow ~20 kHz the mixers are bypassed and the signals are sampled directly." (at 30 20 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid a55803d7-5a26-4afe-9131-0d1b36826e3b))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
